WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Welcome to the video guide to Amazon business customers.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.320
Amazon sellers list, price, and ship

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.600
products to customers around the world.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.160
Many of those customers buy items for personal use.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.080
They purchase products in small quantities for themselves, their families, or their friends.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.500
Another group of Amazon customers buys items for professional use.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.768
These business buyers are

00:00:23.768 --> 00:00:27.340
often employees of companies, nonprofits, or government organizations.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.522
Some are also procurement

00:00:29.522 --> 00:00:33.080
professionals tasked with sourcing products on a regular basis.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:34.938
Business customers frequently

00:00:34.938 --> 00:00:38.600
want top purchasing power to secure larger quantities of goods.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.420
They value selection and look for

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.900
discounts on bulk purchases.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.749
They also want to streamline procurement and make distributing

00:00:46.749 --> 00:00:48.520
products as efficient as possible.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.840
At Amazon, we provide business buyers with a range of

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:54.660
purchasing solutions through Amazon business.

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:58.237
With a free Amazon business account, buyers keep

00:00:58.237 --> 00:01:00.500
their personal and work shopping separate.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.687
They can also convert their personal account if they

00:01:03.687 --> 00:01:06.540
want to shop on Amazon exclusively as a business customer.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.147
Anyone can create an Amazon business

00:01:10.147 --> 00:01:11.451
account at business.

00:01:11.451 --> 00:01:11.885
amazon.

00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:12.320
com.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:16.980
Having an account gives professional buyers several advantages.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.660
Amazon business customers have the opportunity to review business-only product selections.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:28.543
They can also view business-only pricing and quantity discounts and can access time-saving

00:01:28.543 --> 00:01:31.200
features that help them run their businesses better.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.257
Organizations can select from a variety

00:01:34.257 --> 00:01:37.000
of features depending on their needs and goals.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:40.300
Small businesses use Amazon business to find

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.040
flexible payment options and to secure free shipping with business prime.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.273
Big businesses use Amazon

00:01:46.273 --> 00:01:52.022
business to get custom reports on their purchasing trends and to make buying easier to track and

00:01:52.022 --> 00:01:52.360
reconcile.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:58.892
Nonprofits use Amazon business to comparison shop in relevant categories to set up

00:01:58.892 --> 00:02:04.424
approval workflows across agencies and to ensure they are sourcing products from sellers with

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.400
particular diversity and quality certifications.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.181
All these features and more are available to every

00:02:10.181 --> 00:02:12.500
buyer who opens an Amazon business account.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.480
To learn more about Amazon business and how you

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:22.240
can grow your own business by selling to professional buyers, see our module "Introduction to Amazon

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.020
Business Features." This concludes our video.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:27.600
Thank you and happy selling on Amazon!
